The PluginManager class is sealed, so it cannot be mocked by Moq. I will create a minimal fake PluginManager class implementing only the FailPlugin method to track calls. Then I will inject this fake into the ApplicationHost test subclass.

I will also implement the abstract method GetAssembliesWithPartsInternal in the test subclass.

